ational Services information for current facility access before planning a workout, swim, climb, or intramural activity.","short_summary":"Luther’s recreation hub includes fitness equipment, a climbing wall, and an aquatic center.","evidence_claim":"Luther identifies Gerdin Fieldhouse as the location of exercise facilities, including strength and fitness equipment, a 30-foot climbing wall, and an aquatic center.","source_url":"https://www.luther.edu/offices/residence-life/new-student-information","source_title":"New Student Information | Luther College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Confirm current recreational access, equipment availability, and any required orientation before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Event schedules, ticketing, and facility access can change; verify directly with Luther before each visit."]}],"warnings":[]}
